  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research on key themes in Brazil and production of resources for Brazil&apos;s 2016-2021 Strategy Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This consultancy aims to provide the Brazil and Paraguay team with research material, data collection and analysis and an insight into themes and tendencies in Brazil for the next five years. With this research/report we also wish to understand  how these trends will impact the most vulnerable groups in the country and explore possible areas of work that could alleviate that impact. The research will focus on the most vulnerable groups in society (rural and urban) and will provide insights and analysis on the following areas: Social; Politics; Economics; Technology and Environment and the role of Brazil in the world. 

Another objective of this consultancy is to have an interactive discussion with the Brazilian report to the United Nations on the Millennium Development Goals which will be presented in July by the government and where new objectives will be agreed. 

We hope to specifically use this report as a guidance in helping us define and re-define our work strategy in Brazil for the period of 2016-2021.</narrative>
  </description>
